<p>Hello <strong><%= @display_name %></strong>,</p>
<p>Welcome to <strong>HomeSchool Hub</strong> as a child account.</p>
<p>Quick start:</p>
<ol>
  <li>Sign in to your child dashboard and open your lessons.</li>
  <li>Use your profile page to review account details.</li>
  <li>Ask your parent to resend the invite if another child account needs setup.</li>
</ol>
<p>
  If you ever need to reset your password, use this link:
  <%= link_to "Reset password", new_user_password_url %>.
</p>
<% if @parent.present? %>
  <p>This account is linked to parent: <strong><%= @parent.email %></strong>.</p>
<% end %>
